>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `MODEL_REFUTE_TAC`

``` hol4
Refute.MODEL_REFUTE_TAC : Abbrev.tactic
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Runs the finite model finder on the current tactic goal.

`MODEL_REFUTE_TAC` is `REFUTE_TAC_WITH [upd_search (Only [ModelFinder])]`:
it runs only the `kodkod` backend, with every other field of
`!Refute.the_config` as read when the tactic is applied.  It prints the
resulting `Counterexample`, `NoCounterexample`, or `Unknown` report
(`Model` or `NoModel` when `falsify` is false) and then behaves as
`ALL_TAC`, never closing or altering the goal; a counterexample is not a
tactic failure.  `quiet` and `expect` are honoured.  Without a
configured Kodkodi the search is `Unknown`.

### Failure

Fails only when a non-default `expect` field is not met.  Interrupts
are re-raised.

